<title>NEW ZEALAND: Franklin declares holding in CHH.</title>
<headline>Franklin declares holding in CHH.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. fund Franklin Resources Ltd said on Tuesday that on January 7 it had become a substantial security holder in forest products group Carter Holt Harvey Ltd with a 5.01 percent stake.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
